        "heading_YKycHY": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How it Works",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_GzyEmy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When your candle is finished, clean the jar and lid before bringing them back. Remove all remaining wax and residue — warm water and a paper towel usually does it. Returns that aren't clean or are in poor condition can't be accepted, but we'll always let you know on the spot with no awkwardness.</p><p>Once you've got a clean vessel, bring it back next time you see us at a farmer's market or pop-up. Hand it over at the table — no forms, no shipping, no hassle. We'll check it on the spot and hand you a discount to put toward anything at the market that day, or save it for a future visit.</p>"
          }
        }
